   "widgets_values": [
    "COSPLAYER - fictional character costume.\nMode 'Costume only' (default) sends costume + signature hair/eyes and lets the person randomize; 'Full character' also locks the physique for a faithful look.\nrandom_scope narrows Random picks to a franchise/category/attribute.\nCrossplay: set the person's gender independently of the character.\nUnmask toggle reveals the head under a full-mask suit.\nA named beast (Appa, Toothless...) renders as the animal, not a wearer."
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "COSPLAYER - fictional character costume.\nMode 'Costume only' (default) sends costume + signature hair/eyes and lets the person randomize; 'Full character' also locks the physique for a faithful look.\nrandom_scope narrows Random picks to a franchise/category/attribute.\nCrossplay: set the person's gender independently of the character.\nUnmask toggle reveals the head under a full-mask suit.\nA named beast (Appa, Toothless...) renders as the animal, not a wearer."
