   "widgets_values": [
    "TURNAROUND - reference sheet (camera only).\nWire Identity Forge's prompt_json in; it emits front / three-quarter / profile / back as a LIST, so one queue renders the whole set of the SAME person.\nIt only moves the camera - character and scene stay on Identity Forge.\nThe straight-back view OMITS the face (eyes, lips, makeup, expression) so the model renders a back.\nControls are camera-only: no seed, no re-roll between views."
   ],
